0	Shieldkeeper
1	A front-line fighter who blocks with spear and shield, then strikes back. Great at shoving foes off the island's edge.
2	Wandering Blade
3	Slashes fast with twin blades, slips past attacks, then counters.
4	Windcaller
5	A caster of wind and lightning. Strikes from afar and shields with clouds.
6	Trapper
7	Fights at range with crossbow and traps. Trapped foes can't move.
8	Bellringer
9	Rings bells with a hammer to spread shockwaves. Calls echo clones to fight alongside.
10	STR
11	Melee damage +1%, needed for heavy gear
12	AGI
13	Attack speed, crit, evasion (Trapper: damage +1%)
14	VIT
15	Life +4, status resistance
16	BRE
17	Wind +2 and regen, magic damage +1%
18	Pierce
19	A long thrust that pierces every foe in a line.
20	Rapid Thrust
21	Thrusts three times fast (70% each).
22	Far Thrust
23	Range +50%, knocks hit foes far back.
24	Sweep
25	Swings the spear wide, hitting every foe around you.
26	Whirling Spear
27	Spins for 1.5s, hitting many times.
28	Sweeping Shove
29	Knocks hit foes far away. Near the island's edge…
30	Shield Bash
31	Bashes foes in front with your shield and stuns them briefly.
32	Shield Charge
33	Charges three tiles, shoving foes you hit.
34	Ringing Shield
35	Stun 2s, wider area.
36	Stand Firm
37	Take 30% less damage for 6s (+2% per level).
38	Retaliate
39	Returns 40% of damage taken while standing firm.
40	Solid Ground
41	Can't be knocked back, and life regenerates.
42	War Cry
43	Draws nearby foes' attention and raises your defense.
44	Intimidate
45	Foes flee for 2s.
46	Courage
47	Attack +25% for 8s.
48	Wind Banner
49	Plant a banner; wind and life regenerate there for 8s.
50	Gust Banner
51	Pushes nearby foes away every 2s.
52	Haven Banner
53	Double healing.
54	Gust
55	A gust that blows foes back.
56	Cutting Wind
57	Damage +40%, hit foes bleed for 3s.
58	Great Gust
59	Much larger area and knockback.
60	Whirlwind
61	A slow whirlwind that pulls foes in and keeps hitting them.
62	Twin Whirlwind
63	Splits into two.
64	Lingering Whirlwind
65	Stays in place for 3s.
66	Lightning Bolt
67	A fast bolt of lightning.
68	Forked Lightning
69	Splits three ways (70% each).
70	Piercing Lightning
71	Passes through foes.
72	Chain Lightning
73	Lightning that jumps between nearby foes (4 times).
74	Long Chain
75	Jumps up to 7 times.
76	Numbing Lightning
77	30% chance to stun hit foes.
78	Cloud Shield
79	Wraps you in cloud that absorbs damage (scales with BRE).
80	Frost Cloud
81	Foes that hit you are slowed.
82	Rain Cloud
83	Life regenerates while it lasts.
84	Fog Veil
85	Spreads fog; foes inside slow down and often miss.
86	Thick Fog
87	Lasts 10s.
88	Storm Cloud
89	Strikes foes inside with lightning every second.
90	Rapid Slash
91	Slashes ahead three times fast (70% each).
92	Fourth Slash
93	One more big slash at the end (200%).
94	Rending Slash
95	Wider area, hit foes bleed for 3s.
96	Blade Wind Spin
97	Spin for 1.2s, slashing all around. You can move while spinning.
98	Long Spin
99	Spins for 2s.
100	Pulling Blade Wind
101	Pulls nearby foes inward.
102	Wind Cutter
103	Dash forward, slashing every foe in your path. You can't be hit while dashing.
104	Return Cut
105	Shortly after, dash back to where you started and slash again.
106	Afterimage
107	Blade wind lingers on your path for 2s.
108	Parry
109	Take a stance for 1.2s. If hit, deflect the damage and counter all around (250%).
